MODIFICATIONS & LOCAL PATCHES
-----------------------------

Per Apache License 2.0 section 4(b), the following changes were made to the
vendored copy. See full details in `docs/VENDORED_PYJIANYINGDRAFT.md`:

  1. pyJianYingDraft/draft_folder.py:
     Validates project names via `core.path_validation.validate_project_name`
     to constrain draft operations to draft root, guarding against path traversal.
     Import hoisted to module scope per PEP 8.

  2. pyJianYingDraft/script_file.py:
     Integrated fast `orjson` serialization with fallback to stdlib `json`.
     Optimized materials duplicate check from O(N) list to O(1) set.

  3. pyJianYingDraft/track.py:
     Added O(1) fast-path chronological `add_segment` when appending media.

  4. Decoupling:
     Eliminated cyclical dependencies back to the `app` package.

PINNING & MAINTENANCE
---------------------

Baseline established against GuanYixuan/pyJianYingDraft v0.2.x series.
Local modifications are maintained as an auditable patch set documented in
`docs/VENDORED_PYJIANYINGDRAFT.md`. Future upstream merges should re-apply
these patches on top of upstream releases.


